  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Often when scrolling short menus in VR I do so with a large flick that starts on the menu, and ends outside the menu. This works perfectly fine on the full menu.\nHowever, with QM open, this can result in selecting another user if the trigger is released while the laser is hovering over someone. This will switch QM page to user page, which is most decidedly not what I wanted to achieve by scrolling.",
